{"id":"d_counseling_trina_12","cat":"counsel","group":{"id":"char5134","label":"Trina"},"label":"Advising Trina: 12","stage":null,"prev":"d_counseling_trina_11","next":"d_counseling_trina_13","speakers":{"trina":"Trina"},"icons":{"trina":"si_c412_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_counseling_trina_12_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_trina_12_1","text":"Sometimes, the little ones wonder what it would be like up on the surface.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CommanderRoom","bgArt":"commanderroom","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_backtonormal","movie":null,"shown":["trina"],"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_trina_12_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_trina_12_2","text":"I understand their eagerness,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_trina_12_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_trina_12_3","text":"but the climate on the surface is much harsher than it is in the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_trina_12_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_trina_12_4","text":"The little ones have already adjusted to this environment, but I worry that their hopes of seeing the surface will be dashed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_trina_12_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_trina_12_5","text":"I want to help them prepare themselves mentally, but how should I go about it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_trina_12_6","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_trina_12_6","text":"How about telling them stories about the surface?","jump":"d_counseling_trina_12_8","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_120"},{"id":"d_counseling_trina_12_7","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_trina_12_7","text":"Let's take them up to the surface and give them an experience.","jump":"d_counseling_trina_12_11","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_100"},{"id":"d_counseling_trina_12_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_trina_12_8","text":"Ah, that's a great idea!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_trina_12_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_trina_12_9","text":"That way, they'll understand that the world can be a harsh place,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_trina_12_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_trina_12_10","text":"and it won't catch them by surprise.","jump":"d_counseling_trina_12_14","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_trina_12_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_trina_12_11","text":"But wouldn't that scare them, doing it all so suddenly?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_trina_12_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_trina_12_12","text":"I realize they seem strong, but they're still quite tender at heart.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_trina_12_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_trina_12_13","text":"I believe we should introduce these things to them slowly.","jump":"d_counseling_trina_12_14","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_trina_12_14","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_trina_12_14","text":"I talk with Trina bout how to help trees grow from within.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"none","bgArt":"none","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"}]}